// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3453711482" "All that I have learned points to a single, ominous fact. The hated mages of the Circle of Thorns have completed a great ritual, no doubt meant to bring harm down upon us all. I must know the nature of their act before I can counter it, but if I act now it will alert them. Thus, I must work through an emissary and I would chose you for this task. <br><br>Even now, the Circle of Thorns' foul wizards have struck against the descendants of Mu. Along with the normal people they often abduct, they have taken several of my mystics. We may have located one of them. He must be recovered, and their reason for this action discovered. I believe that these foul abductions are part of the outline of their larger plan, so thwarting a part may reveal the whole. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I would task you to this rescue, as you have shown some ability to get things done.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3324082720" "Recover the missing mystic and discover the reason for his abduction."
// SendOffString :
"P1375282152" "I have used my arts to divine his general location, but can proceed no further through the defense wards the Circle has erected. Free my fellow Mu Mystic, destroy the leader of this Circle Coven, and search for the reason they dared to strike. <br><br>I do not care about the lives of the other abductees. Ignore them or not as is your whim."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2807257170" "Attack Circle Abductors"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P391631422" "Must I repeat myself? Free my fellow Mu Mystic, destroy the leader of this Circle coven, and search for the reason they dared to strike against us."

