// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P690093490" "Another fine batch. <br>Good. <br>We need more to satisfy her appetite, and our need."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1807303300" "You're not on my list, {VillainName}, but you'll do."

