// Dialog :
"P638677146" "You found some orders on the base leader."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Safe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2252294519" "Safe"
// Description :
"P984845122" "Find Book"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1257149305" "You begin opening the crate"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4206309487" "You have opened the crate"
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2974894735" "You found something"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1547366479" "You got the book and defeated the base leader."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3212172663" "This book will be a valuable recruiting tool. But more importantly, it will tell us how long the hated Circle of Thorns has persecuted the descendants of Mu. All this, and Infernal is here as well. A vigilante, a curse, a demoness, and yes! The destruction of the world. This is truly a challenge. Even if you weren't cursed, I'd think a connoisseur of mayhem such as yourself would relish being a part of this."
// RandomFameString :
"P2606485149" "I swear it! I saw this big hulking guy in armor with an axe. It looked just like that vigilante Infernal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2443967690" "Though he would seek shelter from my mystic sight, I have still found the one called Infernal. His barriers and wards do not deceive me. The binder-of-demons' pure heart shines like a beacon, and in that light I can see his surroundings. He even now guides an expedition formed of Longbow Operatives into one of the lost chambers of Mu. The Circle are bent on stopping him, so whatever he searches for is of interest to them. This makes it of interest to me, and thus, I will make it of interest to you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Defeat Infernal, and learn what it is he seeks.</A> <color orange>Be warned that you will likely need an entire gang of others to assist you in this task. Infernal will not be easily defeated.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1741531813" "Defeat Infernal"
// SendOffString :
"P2598309137" "It is my belief that Infernal seeks information about this 'Lilitu'. If she is the Circle's new demonic ally, knowledge of her and her plans could go a long way towards thwarting the machinations of the Circle of Thorns, as well as removing the curse you bear. Infernal is unlikely to share information with one such as you, so you will likely have to pry what Infernal knows from him. <br><color orange>I would suggest you gather a gang of others to go with you.</color> Infernal's powers are extraordinary, and his defeat will not be easy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2627077772" "Mu'Drakhan's divinations have led you through twisting caverns to this ancient place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2907409932" "They would dare to intrude!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P558591344" "Drive them from this place!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2734402751" "Infernal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1196842586" "As I suspected, the inscriptions match. <em>She was here, all those lost ages ago. <em>Mother..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2390533969" "You have brought ruin to my friend Najjar, <em>know that I shall bring ruin upon you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2612265417" "Know the agony of abyssal flame!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3898693950" "If only your power in battle was matched by a spiritual strength. <em>It is a tragedy that you are so out of balance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3244641657" "We will... Meet... Again, {VillainName}... <em>This, I swear!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P688674821" "Should the next turn of the wheel of incarnation see you return as a demon, <em>I will bind you to this armor to pay for your crimes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DefeatInfernal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P84099023" "You recovered some of the information Infernal had discovered."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P13862487" "You defeated Infernal and found some vital information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3344559376" "These scraps of biased Oranbegan history are new and will be exposed as lies on further research. However, the important information is about this 'Lilitu'. She is clearly an enemy of the descendants of Mu and an ally of the Circle. Even the vigilantes of Paragon City know of her and the threat she represents. The Circle's plans must be uncovered. I am, in particular, disturbed by Infernal's concern that this may be part of a Circle attempt to finish the slaughter their spiritual forbears began in that ancient war."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1164910124" "I have learned the location of two of our mystics held by the foul Circle of Thorns. I now believe that his capture was part of the Circle's plot. If these mystics seek to bind the demoness Lilitu to their power as their spiritual forbears did once before, proof that we have revived the greatness of Mu would go a long way. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Recover this brother of the blood of Mu, and see what he has learned.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3696977845" "Rescue Mu Mystics from Circle"
// SendOffString :
"P211337481" "You must find and bring both mystics back alive, or forfeit your full payment. They may have valuable information that could lead us to the heart of this Circle plot, and possibly Lilitu herself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3345436500" "Once more you find yourself in a section of the ruined city beneath the Rogue Isles."

