// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - MysticSafe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - OtherMystic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3987211881" "A strange Reliquary"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2705887867" "You begin opening the Reliquary"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2937859216" "You have opened the Reliquary"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2016618002" "A strange crystal inside speaks to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3163760646" "You rescued both of the Mu Mystics"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3144005261" "You weren't able to rescue both mystics, but you still learned enough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1684214052" "What horror is this? The cult of the Circle of Thorns, this secret society we have fought, is not a cult at all, but the continuation of the sworn enemies of our people? A spirit city of the dead beneath Paragon? Body thieving ghost wizards? And now the return of a Demoness and a plan to eradicate us all? I must find this ancient ancestor Mu'Ken spoke with. I shall bend all the powers of divination I can muster to this task! <br><br>Do not think I have forgotten you, {VillainName}. For uncovering this, I shall place great efforts towards ending this curse upon you. Once this task is complete, of course."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3315974142" "What horror is this? One of my men dead, the other's soul trapped in a crystal? The cult of the Circle of Thorns, this secret society we have fought, is not a cult at all, but the continuation of the sworn enemies of our people? A spirit city of the dead beneath Paragon? Body thieving ghost wizards? And now the return of a Demoness and a plan to eradicate us all? I must find this ancient ancestor Mu'Ken spoke with. I shall bend all the powers of divination I can muster to this task! <br><br>Do not think I have forgotten you, {VillainName}. Despite your failure, you still uncovered this abomination, I shall place great efforts towards ending this curse upon you. Once this task is complete, of course."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3179897019" "I have found the soul of our ancient ancestor. She remains in the clutches of the Circle of Thorns, but I sense great peril. Even now interlopers from Longbow battle the Circle for the crystal that holds her soul. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I charge you to recover her and find out what she knows.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4369823" "Recover Ancient Mu soul Crystal"
// SendOffString :
"P1097500794" "The greatest thing you must do is recover the soul of the ancestor, but we must not play our hand too blatantly. Therefore, chaos must be created. Since there are already two sides battling each other, escalate the conflict into chaos by defeating the leaders of both sides. This will leave no clear indication to them who rescued the ancient one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1738397326" "The sounds of battle bring a chaotic life to these ancient sunken halls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2309881660" "Longbow Leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3063050032" "Infernal's relying on us. We can't fail!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P800568921" "{VillainName}! That's something we really don't need!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - LBLeader 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1175504544" "Longbow leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1615846404" "You defeated the Longbow expedition's leader."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2834726197" "Get that Crystal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4207279928" "Circle Defense Leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2240885853" "I tell you, this is a distraction!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3424238777" "You arrive like a vulture, cursed one, but all you will find is your death."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CoTLeader 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1143831454" "Circle Defender"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P738546326" "You defeated the leader of the Circle's defenses."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - MuSoul 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P80848541" "A Soul Crystal Reliquary"
// Description :
"P3194344784" "Take Crystal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2701870603" "The soul Crystal inside speaks to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1431169013" "You recovered the crystal and sowed chaos in your wake."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3903555912" "You bring more than an honored ancestor, {VillainName}, you bring our first true chance to stop the dread plans of the Circle of Thorns. If Lilitu is weakened from her battle with Infernal, then now is the time to strike her. No doubt she is prepared for the magics of the Mu, but I doubt she is prepared for one such as yourself. I will see what aid I can draw from the armaments of Arachnos for you. Prepare a strike team. When you are ready, it will be time to bind a queen of Demons. <br><br>And on a topic of interest to you, I have learned more about the curse placed upon you. It's actually quite simple. It has fused your fate to that of the Mu. Should the Circle succeed, you will perish as we will, however, since our researches in the Blood Tome have revealed that there are approximately 1 billion people on Earth with a trace of Mu ancestry, and there is only one of you, you'll experience that fate a billion times over before you'll finally die. There is one potential method of salvation for you, however. Should you defeat the Demon Queen Lilitu in combat, the curse should be broken. It's direct, but perhaps achievable."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3619902219" "Whatever foul bargains the Circle may have planned, they will end now. With the help of the trapped soul of the ancient one, I now know where Lilitu hides, recovering from wounds suffered in battle against Infernal. Now is the time to strike. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I am tasking you with the defeat and capture of this 'Lilitu'.</A> Her downfall will secure some measure of safety from the Circle of Thorns for both of us.<br><br>Be warned, however, that even weakened she will still be powerful. <color orange>Bring as many of your cronies as possible.</color> <br><br>There will be other complications. Firstly, after Lilitu is bound within the spirit trap, it will increase the 'Spiritual Mass' of your group such that we will not be able to automatically extract you while you're still conscious. Her defeat and binding will be felt. Once that's done, I would expect agents of Longbow and even her son to arrive. I thus recommend a hasty exit."
// AcceptString :
"P1000477076" "Defeat and capture Lilitu"
// SendOffString :
"P191227049" "This act will not only preserve those blessed with the blood of Mu from the dark designs of our eternal enemies, but should aid you as well. Lilitu's direct defeat should break the curse on you, unchaining your fate from their bargain with the demoness. Sometimes magic can be simple. <br><br>I have used my considerable influence to procure an experimental tool for your use. It's a spirit trap, and should weaken Lilitu to some degree. <br><br>Remember that you will not be able to leave so easily once you have captured her. And, remember that a capture team from Longbow will no doubt arrive soon after."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3009883914" "Defeat and Capture Lilitu"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1137238890" "You must defeat Lilitu herself. Gather cronies and henchmen, gather a gang or enclave of black-hearted rogues, do as you must. But Lilitu must fall."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4122194708" "You almost didn't need to be told where to go. You can feel Lilitu's evil presence even out here."

