// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3388520853" "Ghost-Wizards of Oranbega, I have given you the final ritual! Now why aren't the last of the Mu dead? <em>Useless! <em>Worthless! <em>Pathetic and weak! <em>Could you disgust me more?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1542552405" "All of you pathetic mortals are bugs before me! I will kill every last one of you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1733743582" "Die now before you begin to annoy me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1428805076" "You've injured my beautiful body. <em>I'll remove your bones for that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1172025742" "If that leaves a scar, I will visit such horrors on you as this world has never before witnessed."

